  "notes": "{誘|さそ}う is a godan verb meaning to invite someone or to tempt/evoke something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle for the person/thing being invited or evoked\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. To invite: ⟦{友達|ともだち}→友達：01478_tomodachi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{映画|えいが}→映画：02273_eiga⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{誘|さそ}う (invite a friend to a movie)\n2. To evoke: ⟦{涙|なみだ}→涙：02235_namida⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{誘|さそ}う (bring to tears)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ + ⟦{場所|ばしょ}→場所：00829_basho⟧/⟦{活動|かつどう}→活動：00201_katsudou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ + {誘|さそ}う: to invite someone to somewhere/something\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{食事|しょくじ}→食事：02087_shokuji⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{誘|さそ}う: to invite to dinner\n- ⟦{飲|の}み→飲む：00322_nomu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{誘|さそ}う: to invite for drinks\n- ⟦{眠|ねむ}り→眠り：13673_nemuri⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{誘|さそ}う: to induce sleep\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{誘|さそ}い→誘い：14200_sasoi⟧: invitation (noun)\n- ⟦お→お：03097_o⟧⟦{誘|さそ}い→誘い：14200_sasoi⟧: invitation (polite)\n- {誘|さそ}われる: to be invited (passive)",
